  "idea": "Obsidian: build an interconnected personal knowledge base for free",
  "text": "Why everyone is obsessed with bidirectional linking in this free software. Traditional note apps force you to categorize thoughts into rigid subfolders where related concepts get buried. When your folder tree grows beyond a dozen levels, tracking down cross-functional insights takes forever. Instead, use double brackets in Obsidian to connect ideas dynamically across your entire personal archive. You instantly spot hidden patterns across your research, giving you your weekends back.",
